{"id": "tea:antakrddasa:3.8", "source": "src:antakrddasa", "location": {"ref": "3.8"}, "paraphrase": "Gajasukumāla, Kṛṣṇa's young brother, became a monk under Ariṣṭanemi and stood in meditation in a cremation ground; the brāhmaṇa Somila, his would-be father-in-law, set a rim of clay on his head and filled it with burning coals. Without anger, regarding Somila as a helper in shedding karma, he attained omniscience and liberation that very night.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "experiential", "naya": null, "path": ["meditation"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["karma-liberation", "powers-experiences", "narrative"], "teachers": ["tch:gajasukumala", "tch:neminatha"], "terms": ["trm:upasarga", "trm:nirjara"], "notes": "Chapter ref (varga 3, ch. 8) moderate-low confidence.", "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U34-jain-canon"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U34-jain-canon"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:antakrddasa:6.3", "source": "src:antakrddasa", "location": {"ref": "6.3"}, "paraphrase": "Arjuna the gardener, possessed by a yakṣa, killed many people in Rājagṛha; stopped by the layman Sudarśana's fearless faith, he became a monk of Mahāvīra, bore the beatings and curses of the townspeople with equanimity for six months, and attained liberation.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["action"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["karma-liberation", "narrative", "ethics"], "terms": ["trm:ksama", "trm:parisaha"], "notes": "Chapter ref low confidence.", "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U34-jain-canon"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U34-jain-canon"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
